## What this project changed

- Product name, application identifier, icons and user-facing branding
- A play queue with shuffle, repeat and end-of-track advance
- Playback state events that emit only on change; lazily opened audio device
- Binary-search lookup of the active lyric line
- Notifications pushed by the backend instead of polled
- Development-only features (devtools, WebDriver) moved behind opt-in cargo
  features so release builds ship without them
- Linux build fixes: frontend assets are re-embedded when `dist` changes

## Services

Lyrics are retrieved from [LRCLIB](https://lrclib.net). Sing-Along is an
independent project and is **not** an official client of LRCLIB.

